Envelock -- authorship
=======================

Author and director: Miguel Sanchez
Project page: https://miguelenred.es/envelock

This project is directed by Miguel Sanchez and assisted by artificial
intelligence.

The concept, the architecture, the functional and technical specification, the
design decisions, the priorities, the acceptance criteria and the review are
the author's. The implementation -- the source code (Python encoder, C loader
extension and the graphical assistant), the test suites, the benchmarks and the
documentation -- is produced with the help of several AI models, working from
that specification and under the author's direction, and reviewed by him before
being kept.

Every design decision and every trade-off was made by a human. No line ships
without his review.

The Apache-2.0 license does not require it, but if you build on or ship Envelock,
a visible acknowledgement such as "Powered by Envelock", linking
https://miguelenred.es/envelock, is appreciated.

See NOTICE for copyright and third-party components, and LICENSE for the terms.
